se productive geochemical synthesis and persistence are unresolved. All routes use anoxic surface gas-water systems or staged aqueous compartments. Alkaline sugar production, mildly acidic imidazole assembly, cyanide capture, and acidic hydrolysis are not assumed to occur simultaneously in one pond. Proposed operating windows are distinguished from reported experimental parameters, and missing concentrations or residence times are not invented. The 15 K ice experiments are outside the stipulated terrestrial environments; hot dry CO/H2/NH3 catalysis is not relabeled as demonstrated aqueous hydrothermal synthesis. Molecules use neutral reference formulas with pH-dependent protonation omitted. Discharge reactions are atom-balanceable selected-product projections: hydrogen bookkeeping does not establish measured H2 production, and nitrogen provenance remains unresolved. The network is structurally complete for these selected pathways but is not a fully validated end-to-end geochemical synthesis. No enantiomeric enrichment is assumed.\",\n  \"molecules\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_001\",\n      \"formula\": \"CH2O\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"methanal\",\n      \"common_name\": \"formaldehyde\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/CH2O/c1-2/h1H2\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_002\",\n      \"formula\": \"C2H4O2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"2-hydroxyethanal\",\n      \"common_name\": \"glycolaldehyde\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/C2H4O2/c3-1-2-4/h1,4H,2H2\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_003\",\n      \"formula\": \"C4H8O4\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"(2R,3R)-2,3,4-trihydroxybutanal\",\n      \"common_name\": \"D-erythrose\",\n      \"inchi\": null,\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_004\",\n      \"formula\": \"CH4N2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"methanimida